egin="00:15.913" end="00:16.134">you</span> <span begin="00:16.134" end="00:16.279">to</span> <span begin="00:16.279" end="00:16.993">know</span> <span begin="00:17.231" end="00:17.528">that</span> <span begin="00:17.528" end="00:18.004">I'm</span> <span begin="00:18.004" end="00:18.426">all</span> <span begin="00:18.426" end="00:19.401">yours</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要你明白我完全属于你</span></p><p begin="00:19.411" end="00:22.543" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:19.411" end="00:19.858">You</span> <span begin="00:19.858" end="00:20.058">and</span> <span begin="00:20.058" end="00:20.443">me</span> <span begin="00:20.443" end="00:20.746">run</span> <span begin="00:20.746" end="00:20.903">the</span> <span begin="00:20.903" end="00:21.425">same</span> <span begin="00:21.425" end="00:22.543">course</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你和我奔驰在相同的征程</span></p><p begin="00:22.661" end="00:26.198" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:22.661" end="00:22.952">I'm</span> <span begin="00:22.952" end="00:23.543">slippin'</span> <span begin="00:23.543" end="00:23.846">down</span> <span begin="00:23.846" end="00:23.946">a</span> <span begin="00:23.946" end="00:24.398">chain</span> <span begin="00:24.398" end="00:26.198">reaction</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连锁反应 我滑落深渊</span></p><p begin="00:26.347" end="00:30.129" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:26.347" end="00:26.739">And</span> <span begin="00:26.739" end="00:26.990">here</span> <span begin="00:26.990" end="00:27.228">I</span> <span begin="00:27.228" end="00:27.703">go,</span> <span begin="00:27.703" end="00:27.941">here</span> <span begin="00:27.941" end="00:28.173">I</span> <span begin="00:28.173" end="00:28.649">go,</span> <span begin="00:28.649" end="00:28.887">here</span> <span begin="00:28.887" end="00:29.125">I</span> <span begin="00:29.125" end="00:29.562">go,</span> <span begin="00:29.562" end="00:30.129">go</sp