.925" end="00:43.365">eye,</span> <span begin="00:43.365" end="00:43.633">have</span> <span begin="00:43.633" end="00:43.871">an</span> <span begin="00:43.871" end="00:44.744">eye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但暴风骤雨总有平息的一刻 平息一刻</span></p><p begin="00:45.007" end="00:48.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:45.007" end="00:45.489">Tell</span> <span begin="00:45.489" end="00:45.751">me</span> <span begin="00:45.751" end="00:46.191">you're</span> <span begin="00:46.191" end="00:46.673">covered</span> <span begin="00:46.673" end="00:48.506">tonight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我今夜的你会重归安好</span></p><p begin="00:48.516" end="00:53.515" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:48.516" end="00:48.748">Or</span> <span begin="00:48.748" end="00:49.087">tell</span> <span begin="00:49.087" end="00:49.331">me</span> <span begin="00:49.331" end="00:49.801">lies,</span> <span begin="00:49.801" end="00:50.051">tell</span> <span begin="00:50.051" end="00:50.271">me</span> <span begin="00:50.271" end="00:50.781">lies,</span> <span begin="00:50.781" end="00:53.515">lies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或是对我说谎吧</span></p><p begin="00:54.103" end="00:58.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:54.103" end="00:54.448">I</span> <span begin="00:54.448" end="00:54.650">want</span> <span begin="00:54.650" end="00:54.866">you</span> <span begin="00:54.866" end="00:55.019">to</span> <span begin="00:55.019" end="00:55.758">know</span> <span begin="00:56.022" end="00:56.329">that</span> <span begin="00:56.329" end="00:56.786">it's</span> <span begin="00:56.786" end="00:57.137">our</span> <span begin="00:57.137" end="00:58.140">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要你明白这是属于我们的时刻</span></p><p begin="00:58.170" end="01:01.078" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:58.170" end="00:58.592">You</span> <span begin="00:58.592" end="00:58.793">and</span> <span